y, how can you fly drones and not let me know?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ein"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rei_02_87","text":"Can I join? I've got some equipment that flies as well as a drone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rei_02_88","text":"Sure you can, everybody's welcome.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rei_02_89","text":"I know you don't have anything that flies, so you can borrow Naru No. 3, Zwei.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"zwei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rei_02_90","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"zwei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rei_02_91","text":"If anything bad happens, don't say I didn't warn you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rei_02_92","text":"Relax! There's nothing to worry about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rei_02_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_re